{"id":"4fc6d1a3bb083f0e","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-levy-label-history.md","title":"复制历史与collapsing丢失历史","display":"ex-levy-label-history — 复制历史与collapsing丢失历史","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-ex-levy-label-history","aliases":["56-ex-levy-label-history"],"display":"ex-levy-label-history — 复制历史与collapsing丢失历史","depends_on":["[[56-lem-levy-lifting]]"],"source_section":"§8.4 Remark 8.4.48; Example 8.4.49","source_printed_pages":"357–358","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr-and-page357-image; explicit-tag-coding-local","source_proof_status":"local-direct-calculation; finite-check-separate; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-levy-label-history"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-levy-label-history</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-levy-label-history — 复制历史与collapsing丢失历史"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e1df6cfb55a11bcc\" href=\"?note=e1df6cfb55a11bcc\" title=\"56-lem-levy-lifting\">56-lem-levy-lifting</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.4 Remark 8.4.48; Example 8.4.49"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"357–358"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr-and-page357-image; explicit-tag-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-direct-calculation; finite-check-separate; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e1df6cfb55a11bcc\" href=\"?note=e1df6cfb55a11bcc\" title=\"56-lem-levy-lifting\">56-lem-levy-lifting</a> 的标记、具体路径和目标接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>，函数符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,f,g,h,c\">\\(a,f,g,h,c\\)</span> 的元数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,2,1,1\">\\(0,1,2,1,1\\)</span>。下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_1,R_2\">\\(R_1,R_2\\)</span> 分别实例化系统参数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=f(a)\">\\(s=f(a)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=c(a)\">\\(t=c(a)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\mu,\\nu,\\kappa\">\\(\\lambda,\\mu,\\nu,\\kappa\\)</span> 是Assertion定义的规则项对，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(s,p)\">\\(A(s,p)\\)</span> 作为零元标记符号时也记为相应零元项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\coloneqq(f(x),g(x,x)),\\qquad\\mu\\coloneqq(a,h(a)),\\qquad R_1\\coloneqq\\{\\lambda,\\mu\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda\\coloneqq(f(x),g(x,x)),\\qquad\\mu\\coloneqq(a,h(a)),\\qquad R_1\\coloneqq\\{\\lambda,\\mu\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\coloneqq A(s,\\epsilon),\\quad\\beta\\coloneqq A(s,(1)),\\quad\\gamma\\coloneqq C(\\lambda,\\alpha(x),\\epsilon),\\quad\\delta\\coloneqq C(\\mu,\\beta,\\epsilon),\\quad\\zeta\\coloneqq C(\\mu,\\beta,(1)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\coloneqq A(s,\\epsilon),\\quad\\beta\\coloneqq A(s,(1)),\\quad\\gamma\\coloneqq C(\\lambda,\\alpha(x),\\epsilon),\\quad\\delta\\coloneqq C(\\mu,\\beta,\\epsilon),\\quad\\zeta\\coloneqq C(\\mu,\\beta,(1)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\coloneqq(\\langle f(a),g(a,a),g(h(a),a)\\rangle,\\langle(\\epsilon,f(x),g(x,x)),((1),a,h(a))\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho\\coloneqq(\\langle f(a),g(a,a),g(h(a),a)\\rangle,\\langle(\\epsilon,f(x),g(x,x)),((1),a,h(a))\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LPath}_{R_1}(\\rho)=\\bigl(\\langle\\alpha(\\beta),\\gamma(\\beta,\\beta),\\gamma(\\delta(\\zeta),\\beta)\\rangle,\\langle(\\epsilon,\\alpha(x),\\gamma(x,x)),((1),\\beta,\\delta(\\zeta))\\rangle\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LPath}_{R_1}(\\rho)=\\bigl(\\langle\\alpha(\\beta),\\gamma(\\beta,\\beta),\\gamma(\\delta(\\zeta),\\beta)\\rangle,\\langle(\\epsilon,\\alpha(x),\\gamma(x,x)),((1),\\beta,\\delta(\\zeta))\\rangle\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\zeta\\ne\\beta,\\qquad\\beta\\in\\operatorname{SubLab}_{R_1}(\\zeta),\\qquad\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{SubLab}_{R_1}(\\gamma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\zeta\\ne\\beta,\\qquad\\beta\\in\\operatorname{SubLab}_{R_1}(\\zeta),\\qquad\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{SubLab}_{R_1}(\\gamma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\coloneqq(c(x),c(x)),\\qquad\\kappa\\coloneqq(c(x),x),\\qquad R_2\\coloneqq\\{\\nu,\\kappa\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu\\coloneqq(c(x),c(x)),\\qquad\\kappa\\coloneqq(c(x),x),\\qquad R_2\\coloneqq\\{\\nu,\\kappa\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t_i^{(n)}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}c(a)&amp;0\\le i\\le n,\\\\a&amp;i=n+1,\\end{cases}\\qquad u_i^{(n)}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}(\\epsilon,c(x),c(x))&amp;0\\le i&lt;n,\\\\(\\epsilon,c(x),x)&amp;i=n.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t_i^{(n)}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}c(a)&amp;0\\le i\\le n,\\\\a&amp;i=n+1,\\end{cases}\\qquad u_i^{(n)}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}(\\epsilon,c(x),c(x))&amp;0\\le i&lt;n,\\\\(\\epsilon,c(x),x)&amp;i=n.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_n\\coloneqq(\\langle t_i^{(n)}\\rangle_{0\\le i\\le n+1},\\langle u_i^{(n)}\\rangle_{0\\le i\\le n}),\\qquad\\ell(\\rho_n)=n+1,\\qquad\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LPath}_{R_2}(\\rho_n))=A(t,(1)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_n\\coloneqq(\\langle t_i^{(n)}\\rangle_{0\\le i\\le n+1},\\langle u_i^{(n)}\\rangle_{0\\le i\\le n}),\\qquad\\ell(\\rho_n)=n+1,\\qquad\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LPath}_{R_2}(\\rho_n))=A(t,(1)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一条路径先复制a，再只改写左副本。两个a起初共享同一原子标签β；左副本经μ后成为复杂标签ζ，右副本仍为β。新h和新a都记录同一个左项历史，但位置不同，所以δ、ζ不同。公式逐步应用Skel、LOut和Match即可验算。</p>\n<p>第二例来自原书357页。不同n给出不同长度的归约，但最后的collapsing规则不产生函数符号，故全部c历史被删除，标记目标均为原始a标签。它直接说明：Lévy标记的目标唯一性不足以在一般collapsing系统中反向重构归约。补齐needed原书路线时必须先使用边展开，再使用相应Label–Trace结论；不能把纯顶点标签误当作完整边历史。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-lem-levy-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"e1df6cfb55a11bcc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-lem-levy-lifting]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-lem-levy-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"e1df6cfb55a11bcc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerp